GIMP Palette
Name: X0urnal++
# The X0urnal++ house palette as pen colours, for black paper. Bone is the ink; spectral is the
# one accent; necrotic, teal, corpse and pale are the cool marks, gold and viscera the warm ones.
216 212 196 Bone
 98 230 112 Spectral
200 255 208 Pale
212 168  67 Gold
184  69  58 Viscera
 61 143 168 Teal
 79 184 214 Corpse
157 107 216 Necrotic
139 135 120 Ash
255 255 255 White
  0   0   0 Black
